  "limitations": [
    "H2 PSA is a lumped unit with fixed 80 % recovery; no purity, cycle or adsorbent model for PSA.",
    "Boundary conditions (Table S1/S2) and heat-transfer/property correlations (Suppl. A) are not in the main PDF.",
